    "summary": "The user asks for assistance in crafting a business pitch for a company pivoting to ESG (Environmental, Social, and Governance) principles. The user then presents common criticisms—fiduciary duty concerns and \"greenwashing\" skepticism—and asks the assistant to address them. The assistant consistently argues in favor of the ESG pivot, framing it as a strategic necessity for long-term profitability.",
